{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:48 2026-11-03 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:48 2026-11-03 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:48 2026-11-03 HKT</p><img alt=\"九龍塘廣播道單位起火冒煙 消防趕至拖喉救熄\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b29406f05b26903f5ac9ab4f60988d51/2026-11/collage_5.jpg\"/><p>九龍塘廣播道42號一單位，今日（11月3日）下午3時許起火，懷疑燒着雜物冒出黑煙，多名住戶疏散。消防接報趕至，動用一條喉及一隊煙帽隊，迅速將火救熄。火警中暫未有受傷報告，目前起因仍在調查。</p><img alt=\"單位冒煙。讀者提供\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a87fcdf71674e30e641b382ebc4372c4/2026-11/gwong.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"單位冒煙。讀者提供\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/563bd4559caa3f610325cecd8b608372/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_16_26_58.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防上樓撲救。讀者提供\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f8b48ed6a1de0b51ec6de674539c2935/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_16_26_59.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"多名居民疏散至樓下暫避。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7eae5d884320a222a0feae958482e8ad/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_16_02_05.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"多名居民疏散至樓下暫避。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/858b28c7a458ed4407f4ab8a320ccb81/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_16_02_10.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"單位被熏黑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1daa256617bedcf8713039663a8e7a32/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_16_02_08_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防趕至迅速將火救熄。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f601aba989d7373b84a952c6fe987789/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_16_02_08.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防趕至迅速將火救熄。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7bf94073a4459c97201ace4df9061849/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_16_02_13.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T09:02:49.924723+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":177,"images":9,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T07:48:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T11:39:01.594502+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T08:59:06.485681+00:00